  "summary": "10:00 - 11:20: The traveler and friends explored Dussmann das KulturKaufhaus, browsing books, music, and cultural items while sharing recommendations and enjoying an engaging, social visit."
}

{
  "summary": "11:45 AM - 12:45 PM: The group explored Voo Store’s fashion and homeware, had coffee at its café, then visited Modern Graphics to browse graphic novels and art books and enjoy the creative atmosphere."
}

{
  "summary": "13:00 - 14:30: The group dined at Kimchi Princess, enjoying an interactive Korean BBQ lunch with shared dishes and lively conversation."
}

{
  "summary": "14:45 - 16:45: The traveler and friends enjoyed cheesecake and coffee at Five Elephant café before heading to Dietrich Bar for drinks, games, and a lively social atmosphere."
}

{
  "summary": "17:00 - 19:00: The traveler explored contemporary and digital art at Galerie Met for an hour, then enjoyed Sudanese snacks and lively conversation at Basmah with friends."
}
